## The empty festival

@pim{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: Moon cakes! Lanterns! Harvest sigils! Get 'em while the moon's up!
@narrator{code="0010"}: The square is strung with lanterns. Not one is lit. Nobody is buying.
@pim{code="0020"}: It's the moon. It won't come up full. No full moon, no festival. No festival, no customers.
@lumi{code="0010" emotion="sad"}: The Hollow King took the harvest moon a hundred years ago. Somebody got it back. Nobody knows who.
